{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32957","headline":"和人听歌 一 · 崔珏","name":"和人听歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"气吐幽兰出洞房，乐人先问调宫商。\n声和细管珠才转，曲度沈烟雪更香。\n公子不随肠万结，离人须落泪千行。\n巫山唱罢行云过，犹自微尘舞画梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}